# Copy this file to .env.local (which git, Docker and Cloud Build all ignore) and fill in the value.
# Never commit a real token and never put one in this file.
#
# Optional. A GitHub personal access token raises the API quota from 60 to 5,000 requests per hour.
# Use a token that can only read public data: a fine-grained token with "Public repositories
# (read-only)" access, or a classic token with no scopes selected.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
